  "title": "Vegetable Masala",
  "description": "Masala means a spicy mixture. Vegetable masala is a mixture of vegetables like potatoes, carrots, peas and beans cooked with onions & tomatoes adding spices like garam masala powder, ginger and garlic powder.",
  "authors": [
    "Laxmi Laxman"
